Albert's out-of-network ATM fee is $3.50 in the Albert Cash Account Agreement, the Deposit Account Agreement, and the ATM help article. The Albert Cash Cardholder Agreement lists a different amount, $2.50. I can't tell which agreement applies to your account, so please check in the app or ask support. The ATM operator may also charge its own fee on top of Albert's.

